            <p>The route is primarily served by Amtrak’s Silver Service, offering daily departures between the heart of Orlando and Miami’s central station. Compared to road travel, taking the train helps you avoid highway traffic and makes city center to city center travel easy without worrying about parking or rental cars. </p>

